---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="belove · team" description="The people building belove.">
    <main class="page">
        <a class="wordmark" href="/"><span class="be">be</span><span class="love">love</span></a>
        <h1>team</h1>
        <div class="prose">
            <p><span class="bl">belove</span> is being built by two people with long histories inside the systems it intends to replace. We know how the machinery works. That is why we believe it can work differently.</p>

            <section class="person">
                <img class="photo" src="/team-larry.jpg" alt="" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy">
                <h2>larry muhlstein</h2>
                <p class="role">cofounder · product and research</p>
                <p>Larry has spent years inside the recommendation and personalization systems that decide what billions of people see each day, working on them at companies that shape how the world plays, talks, and thinks: Snapchat, Niantic, and Google DeepMind.</p>
                <p>Underneath the engineering is a research life: deep learning and cognitive science at UC San Diego, published work on personalization, communication, technology, and love, and a long fascination with how minds meet, make meaning, and create culture together.</p>
                <p>Running through all of it is one question: what can technology offer the people it touches? Years of work on responsible AI turned that question into a calling. <span class="bl">belove</span> is his response: personalization devoted to your flourishing.</p>
            </section>

            <div class="team-divider" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>
            </div>

            <section class="person">
                <img class="photo" src="/team-matt.jpg" alt="" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy">
                <h2>matt prewitt</h2>
                <p class="role">cofounder · governance and partnerships</p>
                <p>Matt comes to technology from the law. A former federal law clerk and antitrust litigator, he has spent a career studying how power pools in markets and institutions, and how it can be returned to people.</p>
                <p>As president of the RadicalxChange Foundation, he led a global movement rethinking the basic institutions of democracy, markets, and data, writing and advising widely on data dignity and the democratic governance of technology.</p>
                <p>At <span class="bl">belove</span>, Matt tends the other half of trust: the partnerships, governance, and commitments that make sure the company deserves what it asks of you.</p>
            </section>

            <p class="team-closing">Around us is a wider circle of advisors, friends, and early believers. <span class="bl">belove</span> is small on purpose, and growing with care.</p>
            <p class="team-closing">We'd love to hear from you: <a href="mailto:hello@being.love">hello@being.love</a></p>
        </div>
    </main>
</Base>
